Aggregate text respects each commodity's declared precision and separators.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight aggregate --accounts '^Assets:'

========== FILE ==========

commodity BTC
  format 1000.00000000 BTC
commodity EUR
  format 1,000.00 EUR
commodity JPY
  format 1,000 JPY
account Assets:Bitcoin
account Assets:Euros
account Assets:Yen
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Bitcoin  1234.5 BTC
  Assets:Euros  1234.5 EUR
  Assets:Yen  1234.5 JPY
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

 1234.50000000 BTC  Assets:Bitcoin
1,234.50       EUR  Assets:Euros
1,235          JPY  Assets:Yen

========== WARNINGS ==========
